First of all, it is possible to get items up to +10, but I don't think it is 
possible to get them any higher.

Second, and more importantly, there is some sort of time-out on 
enchanments...if you try to enchant something too often, it can blow-up.  
Also, the higher the enchantment, the higher the chance of it failing (
failure is more likely going from +8 to +9 than going from +2 to +3).

If you still have a fair number of charges and a spare spell-book, try 
writing a spell-book of identify...VERY USEFUL!

